{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"Using the average synodic cycle tied to the reference new moon, not the full astronomical ephemeris. Individual phase times may vary per hour and the UTC dates displayed may differ from the local calendar dates. This global phase estimation does not take into account sunrise, sunset, visibility, or local religious calendars.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"moon-phase-calculator UI copy.fields.methodNote","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"moon-phase-calculator.copy.fields.methodNote","keys":["moon-phase-calculator.copy.fields.methodNote"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Menggunakan siklus sinodik rata-rata yang terikat pada bulan baru referensi, bukan ephemeris astronomis penuh. Waktu fase individu dapat berbeda per jam dan tanggal UTC yang ditampilkan dapat berbeda dari tanggal kalender lokal. Perkiraan fase global ini tidak menghitung tanggal terbit, terbenam, visibilitas, atau kalender agama lokal.","record_id":"3549573261a71556b7a7f70839fd15303b1064c17d047706d315a7b9c6bc8297","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":3.0523898746249998,"source":"Uses a mean synodic cycle anchored to a reference new moon, not a full astronomical ephemeris. Individual phase times can differ by hours and the displayed UTC date can differ from a local calendar date. This global phase estimate does not calculate local moonrise, moonset, visibility, or religious calendar dates.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"30870c684a9b7cbcd78603b289a08388959d9db0a9b4d591addd5741a14786a4","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Menggunakan siklus sinodik rata-rata yang terikat pada bulan baru referensi, bukan ephemeris astronomis penuh. Waktu fase individu dapat berbeda per jam dan tanggal UTC yang ditampilkan dapat berbeda dari tanggal kalender lokal. Perkiraan fase global ini tidak menghitung tanggal terbit, terbenam, visibilitas, atau kalender agama lokal.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
